  "prefLabel": "Plc 1306.03 Obligations of Temporary Licensees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1306.03 Obligations of Temporary Licensees. The holder of a temporary license shall:\n\n(a) Comply with Plc 1308.03 relative to required notifications and Plc 1308.05 relative to posting of licenses; and\n\n(b) Be subject to the ethical and professional standards identified in Plc 1310 and the disciplinary procedures and sanctions identified in Plc 1311.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1300.html"
